%S A399587 2,12,232,15536,65171104,277227881590592
%N A399587 Smallest number m whose binary representation contains representatives of all binary words of length n up to reversal.
%e A399587 n = 1: a(1) = 2 = 10_2; every binary word of length 1, or its reversal, occurs as a contiguous subword.
%e A399587 n = 2: a(2) = 12 = 1100_2; every binary word of length 2, or its reversal, occurs as a contiguous subword.
%e A399587 n = 3: a(3) = 232 = 11101000_2; every binary word of length 3, or its reversal, occurs as a contiguous subword.
%Y A399587 Cf. A400127, A247241.
